{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/blizzard-new/abroad/pulls/10","id":4818241667,"node_id":"PR_kwDOU62qx88AAAABHzCIgw","html_url":"https://github.com/blizzard-new/abroad/pull/10","diff_url":"https://github.com/blizzard-new/abroad/pull/10.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/blizzard-new/abroad/pull/10.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/blizzard-new/abroad/issues/10","number":10,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"CCU：補查104個交換身份、校園素材與分期來源","user":{"login":"blizzard-new","id":262101326,"node_id":"U_kgDOD59ZTg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/262101326?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/blizzard-new","html_url":"https://github.com/blizzard-new","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blizzard-new/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blizzard-new/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blizzard-new/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blizzard-new/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blizzard-new/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blizzard-new/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blizzard-new/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blizzard-new/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blizzard-new/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## 結果與來源範圍\n\n104個中正校級交換身份的資料、校園資產及分期來源盤點。當期母校名額為52公布（49正數／3不限）、3空白、49灰字未開放、0零名額；115／2027春季三梯次皆已截止，下一Fall2027仍「尚未核實新版」，不冒稱官方尚未公告。全部全球協議名單母數仍null。\n\n目前101個核實座標、100張可重用校園照片、102個網站身份；104筆CCU profile。原55筆profile位元組前綴保留，六校profile合計893筆，CGU77／NTPU206／TKU4／NTU288／NCU214不變。\n\n## 最新第六批\n\n- HCMUTE官方GTSD2026實際大學marker補一個座標，保留原城市，不採viewport或個人校區假設。\n- SDU公開factsheet／行前正文補4個接待缺欄，未標適用年皆保留待確認；相同SHA附件不計新版。個人帳號寄送只限制私有表步驟。\n- Sungshin真正Spring2027公告與7份附件已開啟：線上10/26至11/23、正本11/23抵校、開學2027/03/02、選課暫定02/17至19；9項文件與新自填Medical Assessment模板接到平台，沒有把X光／醫師簽章列全體必繳。\n- 新附件仍有Nomination XLSX `Sheet1!V1` 的2025-12-01、博士9／12學分、醫療舊段與其他年份／日期矛盾。2026課表及查課指南截圖只作參考。母校資格、名額、校內文件及已截止視窗獨立保留。\n\n本批僅2個既有CCU adapter接點、新CCU校別module及1筆誠信published workflow更新；另54筆流程保持原位元組。沒有本批新增共用registry／API／UI／資格邏輯變更。原HTTP200／TLS／SHA來源驗證器未放寬。\n\n## 尚待閱讀與外部限制\n\n接待1768欄：350當期核實／313參考／638空值／382待確認／84矛盾／1官方TBC。仍需研究的公開來源與私有步驟分開：\n\n- [104校／2220來源逐校閱讀清單](https://github.com/blizzard-new/abroad/blob/6bd8c3c2d964b8134968b28a204ee24e8f949997/src/exchange_info/official_data/ccu/completion-remaining-public-worklist.json)：410個校別來源缺範圍閱讀記錄，其中37個關鍵字政策候選；757個只證明引用段已讀。另[8個實際識別尚未取得目標](https://github.com/blizzard-new/abroad/blob/6bd8c3c2d964b8134968b28a204ee24e8f949997/docs/ccu-completion-validation-2026-10-11/followup-06/pending-discovered-public-links.json)。\n- [具體剩餘學校與限制](https://github.com/blizzard-new/abroad/blob/6bd8c3c2d964b8134968b28a204ee24e8f949997/src/exchange_info/official_data/ccu/completion-remaining-limitations.json)：座標剩同奈／Karviná Business／墨西哥Uninter；照片剩UEL／同奈／印度Presidency／墨西哥Uninter；網站身份剩啟明／LETI。未授權候選與站點故障不推成全校無公開資料，不重試無新線索的同一路徑。\n- 六校七欄私有步驟有實際登入／提名後個人link證據；公開政策可續查。Gamma取得失敗仍無官方僅限校方證據。必要時用戶最小可取得「全球姊妹校內嵌Gamma現行完整全卡片PDF匯出＋更新日期」，CSV／XLSX同內容可替代；這不是猜官方檔名。\n\n## 實際驗證\n\n[第六批研究及整合說明](https://github.com/blizzard-new/abroad/blob/6bd8c3c2d964b8134968b28a204ee24e8f949997/docs/ccu-completion-validation-2026-10-11/followup-06/research-handoff.md) · [完整結果、來源hash與證據索引](https://github.com/blizzard-new/abroad/blob/6bd8c3c2d964b8134968b28a204ee24e8f949997/docs/ccu-completion-validation-2026-10-11/followup-06/report.json)\n\n- 全部CCU unit＋CGU／NTPU／shared：389項＝385通過、4既有跳過、0失敗。\n- 390／1440桌面手機實頁：18通過；wheel 3556個CCU檔案與工作檔位元組一致。\n- 14個派生輸出重建位元組一致；數量／重複／必填／年度／空值狀態／附件開啟通過。\n- 首輪3舊斷言失敗、前置測試selector與source_url修正均保留日志／JUnit；13項重點修復及完整重跑通過，沒有移除case或新增豁免。未重跑全平台2668；先前NTU截圖路徑及Jena單次失敗的限制仍保留。\n\n固定研究程式 `e3b2df94`；最終測試修正 `fe827b4b`；證據commit `6bd8c3c2`。六個production tree相同。Docker pinned Postgres layer空間阻礙已交整合者，本批未重試或宣稱DB runtime通過；Quality workflow維持原disabled。維持Draft，不merge／deploy。\n","created_at":"2026-10-11T10:03:09Z","updated_at":"2026-10-11T15:15:06Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"fa09d80ec9cf40fa164b171210c2ec34d5d8c2c1","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":true,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/blizzard-new/abroad/pulls/10/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/blizzard-new/abroad/pulls/10/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/blizzard-new/abroad/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/blizzard-new/abroad/issues/10/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/blizzard-new/abroad/statuses/6bd8c3c2d964b8134968b28a204ee24e8f949997","head":{"label":"blizzard-new:data/ccu-completion-20261011","ref":"data/ccu-completion-20261011","sha":"6bd8c3c2d964b8134968b28a204ee24e8f949997","user":{"login":"blizzard-new","id":262101326,"node_id":"U_kgDOD59ZTg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/262101326?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/blizzard-new","html_url":"https://github.com/blizzard-new","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blizzard-new/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blizzard-new/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blizzard-new/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blizzard-new/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blizzard-new/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blizzard-new/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blizzard-new/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blizzard-new/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blizzard-new/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"repo":{"id":1403890375,"node_id":"R_kgDOU62qxw","name":"abroad","full_name":"blizzard-new/abroad","private":true,"owner":{"login":"blizzard-new",